    "collapsible_content_fRxD8G": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_YNAYwR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the Coffee Club & what do I get?",
            "icon": "eye",
            "row_content": "<p>It's a curated coffee subscription, and members get all kinds of perks, but some big ones are: </p><ul><li>Automated delivery of hand-selected coffee just for Club members by our pro specialty roasting team. You’re in control: choose your bag quantity and delivery frequency and we’ll take care of the rest.</li><li>An Onda Origins mug, free with your first order</li><li>Free Shipping (up to a $15 discount depending on where you live)</li><li>Monthly gifts and goodies, like merch and samples of unreleased coffees</li><li>Monthly email newsletter with insider info, resources, and discounts</li></ul><p>Contributing to our revenue share model (<a href=\"/pages/howweredifferent\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"How We're Different\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">more here</span></a>) and supporting growers directly.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TkRbaD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much is a membership?",
            "icon": "price_tag",
            "row_content": "<p>The club starts at just $24/month.</p><p>Pricing depends on how many bags you want and how often you want them. You’ll see all options clearly at signup—no weird surprises, and shipping is always on us. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6naPDt": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How often will I get coffee deliveries?",
            "icon": "truck",
            "row_content": "<p>Choose weekly, biweekly, or monthly—whatever best suits your household and ensures you never run out of beans.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6YX7hH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How many bags will I receive at a time?",
            "icon": "dairy",
            "row_content": "<p>You can choose anywhere from 1 to 4 bags per shipment. Great for solo drinkers, couples, or large households set on caffeinating the entire neighborhood.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_RaMLY9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I cancel, pause, or skip a delivery on my membership?",
            "icon": "return",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! We use a streamlined, user friendly membership portal that lets you change things up at any time, so go for it. You can request a unique, private login link<a href=\"https://ondaorigins.com/a/loop_subscriptions/get-subscription-link\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>, or access your membership via your ondaorigins.com customer page. And if you need help making changes, just email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@ondaorigins.com\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">info@ondaorigins.com</span></a> and we’ll get back to you asap.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ty9VWi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where do you ship?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>We currently ship anywhere in the U.S. (and yes, shipping is free). If you’re outside the U.S., reach out—we may be able to make something happen.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_AQwXxb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the Coffee Club light roast or dark roast?",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>We roast on the lighter side of medium—sweet, vibrant, origin-forward. Not oily diner-dark, not sour science experiment. Just really delicious coffee.</p><p>And if you’re more of a dark roast fan, check out our Neo Noir blend – you can sign up for “Subscribe & Save” to put it on auto-ship and get a discount.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_K3QRL3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use Coffee Club coffees for espresso?",
            "icon": "washing",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Most of our coffees shine as espresso <em>and</em> filter—they’re all complex, bright, and hold up well regardless of brew method.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_H8eBRb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What kinds of goodies do members get?",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Think: surprise tasters, unreleased coffees, stickers, postcards, and other origin-inspired treats. Not every month is the same—that’s kinda the point.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rUpKHC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I gift a Coffee Club membership?",
            "icon": "heart",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Just select “Gift the Coffee Club” when you’re building the membership, and select which pre-paid length you’d like to gift. You’ll be charged for the full duration, your loved one will get the deliveries, and it’ll auto-cancel once it’s run its course.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gTicaT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fresh is this coffee, really?",
            "icon": "fire",
            "row_content": "<p>Preeeetty much couldn't be fresher. We roast and ship same-day, so it's literally hot off the press – I mean machine. The few days it takes USPS to get you your beans is the perfect amount of time for the coffee to “rest.”</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7rNWQd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I choose my own coffee?",
            "icon": "silhouette",
            "row_content": "<p>Our Coffee Club is built on a “Roaster’s Choice” model meant for those who want to explore a range of varietals, processes, and origins – and who don’t want to have to make those selections themselves. Our expert roasters select coffees on a weekly basis based on what’s freshest and tasting the best. </p><p>If you’re more of an “I know what I like” type of person, you’re probably better off with our “Subscribe & Save” option, which lets you automate delivery of any specific coffee you choose. To sign up, just go to the <a href=\"/collections/coffee\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Shop All\">coffee’s product page</a> and choose “Subscribe & Save” before adding it to your cart. (Extra perk : You’ll get $3 off your bag each time.) </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
